{"candidate_id":"figure-analysis:Figure2:8986059850d9d08e","artifact_id":"Figure2","visual_type":"plot","description":"A directed relationship plot for the monolingual Portuguese case. Work Act 0 is connected to TV 0 and TV 1; each temporal version is connected to a Portuguese language version, while manifestations and unofficial publications are connected through derives-from and embodies relationships. An English language version and an English PDF publication also appear on the right.","components":[{"name":"Work Act 0","role":"top-level work","visual_evidence":"Green box at the top, connected by two arrows labeled \"is a realization of\" to TV 0 and TV 1."},{"name":"TV 0 (pt)","role":"temporal version","visual_evidence":"Gray box on the upper left, linked downward to LV 0 pt by an arrow labeled \"derives from\"."},{"name":"TV 1 (pt)","role":"temporal version","visual_evidence":"Gray box on the upper right, linked downward to LV 1 pt by an arrow labeled \"derives from\"."},{"name":"LV 0 pt","role":"Portuguese language version","visual_evidence":"Light-gray box below TV 0, receiving multiple \"embodies\" links from the signed document and publications."},{"name":"LV 1 pt","role":"Portuguese language version","visual_evidence":"Light-gray box below TV 1, linked to TV 1 and receiving an \"embodies\" link from an unofficial Portuguese HTML publication."},{"name":"Signed Document of LV 0 pt","role":"manifestation","visual_evidence":"Purple box at lower left, connected upward to LV 0 pt by an arrow labeled \"embodies\"."},{"name":"Official Publication of LV 0 pt (html)","role":"manifestation","visual_evidence":"Purple box near the lower center-left, connected upward to LV 0 pt by an \"embodies\" arrow."},{"name":"Unofficial Publication of LV 0 pt (html)","role":"unofficial publication","visual_evidence":"Pink box at the bottom center-left, connected upward to LV 0 pt by an \"embodies\" arrow."},{"name":"Unofficial Publication of LV 1 pt (html)","role":"unofficial publication","visual_evidence":"Pink box at the bottom center, connected upward to LV 1 pt by an \"embodies\" arrow."},{"name":"LV 1 en","role":"English language version","visual_evidence":"Light-gray box on the right, connected by a \"derives from\" arrow to LV 1 pt and by an \"embodies\" arrow from the English PDF publication."},{"name":"Unofficial publication of LV 1 en (pdf)","role":"unofficial publication","visual_evidence":"Pink box at the lower right, connected upward to LV 1 en by an arrow labeled \"embodies\"."}],"relationships":[{"source_component":"TV 0 (pt)","relation":"is a realization of","target_component":"Work Act 0"},{"source_component":"TV 1 (pt)","relation":"is a realization of","target_component":"Work Act 0"},{"source_component":"LV 0 pt","relation":"derives from","target_component":"TV 0 (pt)"},{"source_component":"LV 1 pt","relation":"derives from","target_component":"TV 1 (pt)"},{"source_component":"Signed Document of LV 0 pt","relation":"embodies","target_component":"LV 0 pt"},{"source_component":"Official Publication of LV 0 pt (html)","relation":"embodies","target_component":"LV 0 pt"},{"source_component":"Unofficial Publication of LV 0 pt (html)","relation":"embodies","target_component":"LV 0 pt"},{"source_component":"Unofficial Publication of LV 1 pt (html)","relation":"embodies","target_component":"LV 1 pt"},{"source_component":"LV 1 en","relation":"derives from","target_component":"LV 1 pt"},{"source_component":"Unofficial publication of LV 1 en (pdf)","relation":"embodies","target_component":"LV 1 en"}],"findings":["The figure depicts a monolingual Portuguese case in which temporal versions and Portuguese language versions coincide.","Two temporal versions, TV 0 and TV 1, are shown as realizations of the same work.","TV 0 and TV 1 each derive a Portuguese language version, LV 0 pt and LV 1 pt.","LV 0 pt has a signed document, an official HTML publication, and an unofficial HTML publication embodying it.","LV 1 pt has an unofficial HTML publication embodying it and is shown as the source for an English language version, LV 1 en.","The caption identifies the visual as a monolingual Portuguese case where Temporal Versions and Language Versions coincide."],"citations":[{"section_id":"sec-1~5","path_id":"1~5","quote":"2Figure 2: Monolingual case (Portuguese): Temporal Versions (TV) and Language Versions (LV) coincide."},{"section_id":"sec-3.1","path_id":"3.1","quote":"in monolingual jurisdictions (including Brazil), each Temporal Version is effectively monolingual, so the single Language Version coincides with the Temporal Version (see Figure 2)."}],"confidence":0.97,"provenance":{"image_sha256":"d013f398f34f74b2d7866a572206fc09f738b33f52a4b20e5940df0e12f10932","context_sha256":"f9c8ad49d4f8d10b6840d33b90c732bed6bd9b573e71ef29f7f0a1f791eb6ec5","route_id":"figure-qa-luna","protocol":"openai_chat_completions","requested_model":"cx/gpt-5.6-luna","resolved_model":"cx/gpt-5.6-luna","prompt_sha256":"4786e6f3681b05b0e475e188f0fbd61e98def58906b98ae8010b07dfd44df596","output_schema_sha256":"63ab2039b320d553fa1d76cb24dc18bb08c08ae2d7ff54a52ca69c6b19ffa157","schema_id":"chart_extraction","stage1_visual_type":"plot","prompt_task_sha256":"d57ba4ddabf8130ff6774320a2e6f46db83f01e671b0bb4c70426090f883f7b0","route_policy_sha256":"897498afc82f7598dc9ebd6687dba16a821e18722262df3e299e45136eed1940","model_binding_sha256":"01208a249b295331443fdc61a0e35c1fe80cfdaea164f7a8d95c94b82517f43c","input_sha256":"1b85942217cb4588dca0ee6f1cf44b849ff88c465f11082b65bb77eaf55283b6","output_sha256":"965a45a05faf53401c1fa8510c85964553b0a9bec93b0683b2a418ff099b47df","input_tokens":2530,"output_tokens":1103,"latency_ms":21245},"typed_payload":null,"authoritative":false,"import_eligible":false}